{"id": "31091", "title": "越战中的特种作战：国之利芒", "author": "烁金", "category": "历史军事", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/31/31091.htm", "intro": "战中的特种作战。海啸一般的炮击覆盖了前沿阵地，反复地来回轰击。震耳欲聋的爆炸声、强烈的冲击波，各种被炸飞的物体、人的血肉四下横飞，高地前沿瞬间就成为人间地狱。郑尚武抱着头紧紧贴在战壕的地皮上趴着，手肘部位将耳朵遮蔽得严严实实，张大嘴巴对这面前的泥土呼吸。充满TNT味道的空气依然让他觉得肺部灼热，剧烈的爆炸声彷佛就在大脑中心响起一般。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31091", "chapters": [{"title": "引子", "file": "2009131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章 尖兵任务", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "2009133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "2009134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "2009135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "2009136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "2009137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "2009138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "2009139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "2009140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "2009141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "2009142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "2009143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "2009144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "2009145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "2009146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 从战场到军校", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "2009148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "2009149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "2009150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "2009151.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "2009152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "2009153.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "2009154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "2009155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "2009156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 熔炉铸剑", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file":